# Trust: Shikaree Z, the finish's permit test: the Windurst Trust Permit, Three Paths completed. 869; the permit taken
# again inside the open event (a GM): the check fails at the finish, so the handler is not called: nothing learned.
# The check then fails (no permit): the failing talk.
lists WindurstWoods/Perih_Vashai/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/869
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=116,-3.7,90.5 job=WAR lvl=99
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit
mission Cop ThreePaths completed
login
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # 869
delkeyitem WindurstTrustPermit          # a GM, inside the open event
finish                                  # the check fails at the finish: nothing learned
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # no permit: the check fails
finish-if-event
